辣子雞翅麻麻麵...\n嘗試過百麵體，長扁寬細筋道口感不一，搭配各式特色底料紅油\n主椒次麻，碗底再藏蒜香，再點椒末提味；萬不能奪了主料場子，各有層次才相得益彰；\n鹹一分搶肉味，辣一分失腴甜；箇中拿捏盡刁鑽。\n吃麵不圖省事，刁鑽才有這味鮮。\n\n【吃為難】好東西，越簡單越為難。\n\n又要真材實料毫無添加，又要色香俱足實惠動人；\n走透全台訪老廠生麵，每日糰切揪醒不含糊，造就筋道不經日曬，直衝滾水，\n就是要撐得起濃厚大醬不掩麵香\n又有馬友鹹魚細細剝，不嫌氣衝味厚，細熬慢烹取其鮮；桂丁土雞燉湯底，無腥白肉煮醇濃\n直人憨做麵；因為貨真價實，更要厚工熬製，才對得起師傅們的堅持\n此中有心意，為難便也不為難。\n\n【吃有青】隨點現煮，鮮聲逼人\n\n縱使湯麵也要帶鑊氣，直火現煎才有青\n搶時間就是搶口感，爽脆酥麻嫩焦香\n接單現點水滾麵，燒雞炙牛爆油黃；\n盤盤白麵碼、上熱燙好料，蔥如星斗；椒油一淋色香味全具\n刁鑽為難出好麵，簡單從來不簡單\n來二鬼吃氣味，好麵就要有聲有色，暢快淋漓！"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-WnxVTvY0vQY/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/SUxjnd3AdL4/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,[[8,"餐廳"],"查看附近的餐廳"],[1],"新北市三重區",null,null,null,null,[[["CgIgAQ\u003d\u003d","0ahUKEwiP256ftNeWAxWQcvUHHRz2Ig8QhbADCMwCKAA","全部",[["CIHM0ogKEICAgIC0hcS4eQ",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWkbkGdVmMT66DWNDYP5xiY6EMUXKhw1wZM14i-t0VCYdcvZQsPZCLAtljqSVNXSHNJTyDwFkkF_3Ux8TbbjEYm90TkhgGd5uF4iaZvlD-sMW2a_lOIFyjRlk6L24jDfTH7_Mpk\u003dw397-h298-k-no","",[4032,3024],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.49966488635893,25.062742134421306],[0,90],[4032,3024],75],"nAacao-dN5Dl1e8PnOyLeQ","0ahUKEwiP256ftNeWAxWQcvUHHRz2Ig8QzCcIzQIoAA",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[10,"CIHM0ogKEICAgIC0hcS4eQ"],[10,3,[3024,4032]],null,null,[[[2],[[null,null,25.062742134421306,121.49966488635893]]]],[2,null,null,[2],null,[null,null,"photos:local_universal_mobile",[6,7,4,1,3]],null,null,[2019,10,3,16]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["UGCS_REFERENCE","CIHM0ogKEICAgIC0hcS4eQ||","1"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["3765759021744579737","3914613541348935098"],null,"lJRA0qbwHyI"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,0,1,null,0],["CgIgARICGAI\u003d","0ahUKEwiP256ftNeWAxWQcvUHHRz2Ig8QhbADCM4CKAE","最新",[["CIABIhBMO5UUOIgZWiugm7IXRtR1",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.co